  m_Name: Note_SmokedChickenCabbageCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GrandmasHouse::GrandmasHouse.Data.NoteData
  kind: 1
  title: Smoked Chicken & Cabbage
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: 'Smoked Chicken & Cabbage


    A smoked chicken, whole

    Half a cabbage
    and two potatoes, cubed

    Water, and a scoop of salt


    The smoked bird
    goes right in the pot with the rest. Boil it till the cabbage is soft. It''s
    a winter supper; the smoke does the seasoning.'
  marginNote: Walt Hansen's. He wrote it on the back of a feed receipt.
  pages: []
  mentions: []
